    to 1.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16
choice       500000 rows    5.0150 s  (2 iterations, 1 processors)
    The maximum number of processors or cores being used is changed from 1 to
    16.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16
choice       500000 rows    3.7290 s  (2 iterations, 16 processors)
(12 vars, 200,000 obs)
    The maximum number of processors or cores being used is changed from 16
    to 1.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16
multi        200000 rows    6.9610 s  (3 iterations, 1 processors)
    The maximum number of processors or cores being used is changed from 1 to
    16.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16
multi        200000 rows    2.9140 s  (3 iterations, 16 processors)
(7 vars, 200,000 obs)
    The maximum number of processors or cores being used is changed from 16
    to 1.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16
panelfe      200000 rows    4.8080 s  (3 iterations, 1 processors)
    The maximum number of processors or cores being used is changed from 1 to
    16.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16
panelfe      200000 rows    2.5970 s  (3 iterations, 16 processors)
(7 vars, 50,000 obs)
    The maximum number of processors or cores being used is changed from 16
    to 1.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16
bigstrata    50000 rows    3.2850 s  (2 iterations, 1 processors)
    The maximum number of processors or cores being used is changed from 1 to
    16.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16
bigstrata    50000 rows    0.9980 s  (2 iterations, 16 processors)
(22 vars, 1,000,000 obs)
    The maximum number of processors or cores being used is changed from 16
    to 1.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16
choicelarge  1000000 rows   18.9370 s  (2 iterations, 1 processors)
    The maximum number of processors or cores being used is changed from 1 to
    16.  It can be set to any number between 1 and 16
choicelarge  1000000 rows   11.5120 s  (2 iterations, 16 processors)

. postclose `res'

. postclose `coefs'

. use "results/stata_raw.dta", clear

. format seconds loglik %21.0g

. export delimited using "results/stata.csv", replace
file results/stata.csv saved

. use "results/stata_coef_raw.dta", clear

. format estimate %21.0g

. export delimited using "results/stata_coef.csv", replace
file results/stata_coef.csv saved

. erase "results/stata_raw.dta"

. erase "results/stata_coef_raw.dta"

. display "Stata " c(stata_version) ", MP = " c(MP) ", processors = " c(process
> ors_max)
Stata 15, MP = 1, processors = 16

. 
end of do-file
